BEHAVIOR frame-mid

DESCRIPTION
  Writes the fixed 23-byte framing  PROCESSED BY CONSUMER followed by a 0x0A
  newline into buf at offsets 0..22. The caller copies these 23 bytes into the
  output immediately after the 19-character timestamp.

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT buf bytes 256
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH e6d87080

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE buf 32 1 0     # space
  STORE buf 80 1 1     # P
  STORE buf 82 1 2     # R
  STORE buf 79 1 3     # O
  STORE buf 67 1 4     # C
  STORE buf 69 1 5     # E
  STORE buf 83 1 6     # S
  STORE buf 83 1 7     # S
  STORE buf 69 1 8     # E
  STORE buf 68 1 9     # D
  STORE buf 32 1 10    # space
  STORE buf 66 1 11    # B
  STORE buf 89 1 12    # Y
  STORE buf 32 1 13    # space
  STORE buf 67 1 14    # C
  STORE buf 79 1 15    # O
  STORE buf 78 1 16    # N
  STORE buf 83 1 17    # S
  STORE buf 85 1 18    # U
  STORE buf 77 1 19    # M
  STORE buf 69 1 20    # E
  STORE buf 82 1 21    # R
  STORE buf 10 1 22    # newline
END
